.TH QUIPU-GRAPH-LIST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph\-list \- List registered named graphs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph list\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-frozen\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List registered named graphs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-frozen\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
